WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.979
And we will wrap it up with a present moment

2
00:00:03.919 --> 00:00:04.419
radio

3
00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.139
music exercise. So right now

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.580
turn on a random radio station

5
00:00:11.279 --> 00:00:14.240
or ask your smart device to play a random piece

6
00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:14.900
of music.

7
00:00:15.905 --> 00:00:17.845
Whatever comes on, allow yourself

8
00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:21.265
to feel into it and see if it's a match

9
00:00:21.265 --> 00:00:25.664
for you. Just listen to your body's basic like or

10
00:00:25.664 --> 00:00:26.885
dislike reaction.

11
00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:30.989
Ask yourself if it's music that speaks to your state,

12
00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:34.689
or is it above your state on the polyvagal ladder?

13
00:00:35.309 --> 00:00:38.109
And ask yourself, does whatever came on help you feel

14
00:00:38.109 --> 00:00:39.570
more or less grounded?

15
00:00:41.314 --> 00:00:44.054
Does it help you feel more or less safe?

